"900.3.10(270)":{"explanation":"Exception RD 270 keeps the required lot frontage and lot area that existed when the By-law was enacted, sets side setbacks of 1.2 m (4.5 m on a street side) and a 0.3 m garage side setback, and incorporates exception 1462.","code_refs":"none"}
